    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chess Bomb is a unique puzzle game where chess-piece-shaped bombs are used to defeat monsters. Place the bombs on empty squares of the chessboard, and they attack in patterns following the movement rules of chess pieces. The goal of each level is to eliminate all enemies using a limited number of bombs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features various enemies and obstacles, such as stubborn monsters that require multiple hits, mysterious ghosts that appear and disappear, and tiles where bombs cannot be placed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can use powerful White, Black, and Ghost Chess Bombs. For example, the Black Bomb obliterates enemies in one explosive move, while the Ghost Bomb can be placed even on restricted squares. Overcome more than 200 levels with clever strategies and creative thinking, and experience explosive victories on the chessboard!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chess Bomb is a unique puzzle game where chess-piece-shaped bombs are used to defeat monsters. Place the bombs on empty squares of the chessboard, and they attack in patterns following the movement rules of chess pieces. The goal of each level is to eliminate all enemies using a limited number of bombs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features various enemies and obstacles, such as stubborn monsters that require multiple hits, mysterious ghosts that appear and disappear, and tiles where bombs cannot be placed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can use powerful White, Black, and Ghost Chess Bombs. For example, the Black Bomb obliterates enemies in one explosive move, while the Ghost Bomb can be placed even on restricted squares. Overcome more than 200 levels with clever strategies and creative thinking, and experience explosive victories on the chessboard!</p>",
    "short_description": "Chess Bomb is a unique puzzle game where bombs take the shape of chess pieces. Strategically use these explosive chess bombs to fend off waves of invading monsters threatening the chess kingdom.",
